# Product Brands

Products may belong to different automotive brands/manufacturers.

Current supported brands:

- سردساز
- VFN
- ساندن (Sanden)
- سویاب صنعت
- Pukka


# Brand Information

Each product should support:

- Brand name
- Brand logo (optional)
- Manufacturer information
- Product compatibility
- Product category


Example:

```javascript
{
  name: "کمپرسور کولر خودرو",
  brand: "Sanden",
  category: "کمپرسور کولر",
  compatibleVehicles: [
    "پژو 405",
    "سمند"
  ]
}